  "query_preview": "/SUNDAY NIGHT THROUGH FRIDAY/...\nIssued at 425 PM CDT Fri Oct 30 2026\n\nAnother system will move in early next week as a long way \ntrof moves into the Central Plains. Chances for precipitation will \nincrease Monday and Tuesday. As the low tracks across the area will \nalso see winds increase with wind speeds around 25 to 35 mph for \nMonday and Tuesday and wind gusts of 50 mph. Will need to monitor as \nthey system gets closer to see if any headlines for high winds will \nbe needed. As for temperatures through the week, expect highs in the \n50s Tuesday through Thursday. After Tuesday expect drier conditions \nthrough Thursday.",
